# Tab5 LVGL UI pitfalls

Hard-won from taskLVGL Core-0 WDT, status-bar regressions, Phosphor migration. Cross-ref: skill `zig-port` § LVGL render budget; rule `modulus-tab5-ui-ascii`.

## CRITICAL — heap / PSRAM (check sdkconfig FIRST)

### MUST

- **`CONFIG_LV_USE_CLIB_MALLOC=y`** when SPIRAM available — Tab5: `CONFIG_SPIRAM=y`, `CONFIG_SPIRAM_USE_MALLOC=y` (32 MB PSRAM-backed C heap).
- **Opaque scrims** over dashboard (`LV_OPA_COVER`, e.g. `#0A0C12`) — not translucent full-screen overlays with live dashboard refresh underneath.
- **Per-leaf opacity** for dim/disabled widgets — not parent group `lv_obj_set_style_opa` (forces compositing layers every frame).

### NEVER

- **`CONFIG_LV_USE_BUILTIN_MALLOC=y` + `CONFIG_LV_MEM_SIZE_KILOBYTES=64`** on 1280×720 `sw_rotate` UI — 64 KB LVGL pool exhausts/fragments on layer draw buffers → `lv_tlsf_malloc` stalls → Core 0 pinned → **IDLE0 WDT every ~5 s** (repeats without reboot).
- **Misdiagnose as overlay/menu bug** — power-menu cache, defer timer, prewarm helped other issues but **NOT** recurring heap WDT; crash also on **idle dashboard, no button press**.
- **Trust stale backtraces** (`mp3`, settings symbols) — decode with **matching ELF** + addr2line; signature: `lv_tlsf_malloc` / `lv_draw_buf_create` / `buf_malloc`.

## MUST

- **Change-gate every `update()`** — cache last text/style in `static`; skip `lv_label_set_text` / `lv_obj_set_style_*` when unchanged (LVGL always invalidates on call).
- **Real Montserrat tiers** — enable `CONFIG_LV_FONT_MONTSERRAT_12/14/16/22/24/28/36/44` in sdkconfig; assign with `lv_obj_set_style_text_font`.
- **Flex sizing** — `LV_SIZE_CONTENT` on stat columns after `remove_style_all`; explicit pill height (40 px) + `lv_obj_center` inside 80 px bar.
- **Refresh floor ≥30 ms** on LVGL timer (16 ms caused WDT under load).
- **Build before flash** — `zig build test` → `zig build tab5-lib` → `idf.py build` → `idf.py -p COM5 flash`.
- **Phosphor icons** — regenerate via `scripts/gen_phosphor_icons.mjs`; Light for status bar, Fill for dashboard actions.
- **Factory partition 3 MB** when app >1 MB (fonts + icon ROM on 16 MB flash).

## NEVER

- **`lv_style_transform_scale` on labels** under `sw_rotate` 1280×720 — affine layers → full-screen redraw → taskLVGL pins Core 0 → IDLE0 WDT.
- **Unconditional per-tick LVGL writes** in status bar, DRO, jog, overrides — continuous invalidation same symptom as transform_scale.
- **`lv_pct(100)` child width** inside `LV_SIZE_CONTENT` parent — zero-width collapse.
- **Flash without rebuild** — stale image → checksum mismatch, bogus backtraces.
- **`LV_SYMBOL_*` in production UI** — use pre-rendered Phosphor ARGB8888 (`ui_icons.h`).
- **Nested `powershell -Command`** for idf.py — breaks `$env:IDF_PATH`; use direct shell or `scripts/build_tab5.ps1`.
- **`LV_SCR_LOAD_ANIM_FADE_IN`** on dashboard load — full-screen opacity layer under `sw_rotate`.

## Phosphor pipeline

| Surface | Weight | Size |
|---------|--------|------|
| Status bar, settings tabs, chrome | Light | 24/32/40 px |
| Dashboard actions (cycle/hold/home/zero/arrows) | Fill | 24/32 px |

## Verify

```powershell
zig build test
zig build tab5-lib
idf.py build
# user flashes: idf.py -p COM5 flash
# idle dashboard ≥55 s — zero WDT before blaming overlays
```

C-shim-only UI changes → **no ABI epoch bump** unless `CncStatus` / cmd ABI touched.
